flowchart LR
  accTitle: Follow up
  accDescr: After the outcome is recorded, a mother gets visits on days 3, 7, 14 and 42, a baby on days 3, 7, 14 and 28, and both together get both schedules. A visit is due from its date, missed after 3 days and escalated after 7, and missed or escalated visits alarm the coordinator. A visit can be marked done at any point.
  A["Hospital records outcome"] --> B{"Who is the patient?"}
  B -->|Mother| M["Day 3, 7, 14, 42"]
  B -->|Baby| N["Day 3, 7, 14, 28"]
  B -->|Both| D["Both schedules together"]
  M --> V["Due on the date"]
  N --> V
  D --> V
  V -->|3 days late| I["Missed: alarm"]
  I -->|7 days late| J["Escalated: alarm"]
  V --> K["Coordinator marks it done"]
  I --> K
  J --> K
  K --> E["All done: plan completed"]
